{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04TV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{groupoids-section-principal-homogeneous}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5bc9a9dd5f8ab8073d7a0c988ef4f57278b4098d159a101c75ad763536747319", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis section is the analogue of\nGroupoids, Section <REF_0001>.\nWe suggest reading that section first.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4f3b0bd2ce4c1d0409fbee197abf9e2403e4a1e44167a02500ebef0f808e012f", "unit_id": "tag:04TV:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "04TV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$X$", "MATH_0007": "$B$", "MATH_0008": "$a : G \\times_B X \\to X$", "MATH_0009": "$G$", "MATH_0010": "$X$", "MATH_0011": "$X$", "MATH_0012": "$G$", "MATH_0013": "$X$", "MATH_0014": "$G$", "MATH_0015": "$G \\times_B X \\to X \\times_B X$", "MATH_0016": "$(g, x) \\mapsto (a(g, x), x)$", "MATH_0017": "$G$", "MATH_0018": "$X$", "MATH_0019": "$G$", "MATH_0020": "$G \\to X$", "MATH_0021": "$B$", "MATH_0022": "$G$", "MATH_0023": "$G$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-pseudo-torsor}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9dfd9b08d0d3f9b72ed3d78f40782cf610ea38c6f52f1eb1039cfe833b7b3d16", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ba239bdf684e72e81887780c66c734ae098794f56c1a520735c18c9b3430717e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a group algebraic space over <MATH_0005>.\nLet <MATH_0006> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0007>, and let\n<MATH_0008> be an action of <MATH_0009> on <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0011> is a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>pseudo <MATH_0012>-torsor<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> or that <MATH_0013> is\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>formally principally homogeneous under <MATH_0014><TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if the induced\nmorphism <MATH_0015>,\n<MATH_0016> is an isomorphism.\n<STRUCT_0003> A pseudo <MATH_0017>-torsor <MATH_0018> is called <TEXTITOPEN_0003>trivial<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> if there exists\nan <MATH_0019>-equivariant isomorphism <MATH_0020> over <MATH_0021> where <MATH_0022> acts on\n<MATH_0023> by left multiplication.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4d4da6f2e9a39ab624547129d32671d456eb309630f274ed730871fa62dda7da", "unit_id": "tag:04TW:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04TV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B' \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$X_{B'}$", "MATH_0003": "$G$", "MATH_0004": "$B$", "MATH_0005": "$G_{B'}$", "MATH_0006": "$B'$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bfe35810abdc97f93fde9ecda1741144466b604bdceb85d2a0bf5529cfb75fb4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3dea242761fa0ce214104f998ba8e73cec942dd40191c1bbe424710f4780765d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIt is clear that if <MATH_0001> is a morphism of algebraic spaces then\nthe pullback <MATH_0002> of a pseudo <MATH_0003>-torsor over <MATH_0004> is a\npseudo <MATH_0005>-torsor over <MATH_0006>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cacbbbe6b5b965d4599be0aeb884c1eaefb7339fe2c516ffb3591e78c8f04fad", "unit_id": "tag:04TV:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04TV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$G$", "MATH_0003": "$T$", "MATH_0004": "$B$", "MATH_0005": "$X(T)$", "MATH_0006": "$G(T)$", "MATH_0007": "$X(T)$", "MATH_0008": "$G$", "MATH_0009": "$X$", "MATH_0010": "$X \\to B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-pseudo-torsor}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-trivial-pseudo-torsors}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:beab8ff2b5ea72c4cd8d54c8465a954e07e75ee33ba771a569955b107c1a7b97", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d98504c8a22c3a7fdc6304febd963347c809455beb5c1cfd58d1a39c039e3238", "source_text": "In the situation of\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The algebraic space <MATH_0001> is a pseudo <MATH_0002>-torsor if and only if for\nevery scheme <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004> the set <MATH_0005> is either empty or the action\nof the group <MATH_0006> on <MATH_0007> is simply transitive.\n<STRUCT_0003> A pseudo <MATH_0008>-torsor <MATH_0009> is trivial if and only if the morphism\n<MATH_0010> has a section.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b3cd2bfd6de147a87db98745047678226f7877a58b55f8f419115de7b0074329", "unit_id": "tag:04TX:statement"}
